त्यक्त्वा देहं पुनर्जन्म नैति मामेति सोऽर्जुन ॥ ९ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1333,\"bb\":1187,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1187/\",\"body_value\":\"janma karma ca me divyam
evaṁ yo vetti tattvataḥ
tyaktvā dehaṁ punar janma
naiti mām eti so ’rjuna\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1334,\"bb\":1188,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1188/\",\"shadow_value\":\"janma – birth; karma – work; ca – also; me – of Mine; divyam – transcendental; evam – like this; yaḥ – anyone who; vetti – knows; tattvataḥ – in reality; tyaktvā – leaving aside; deham – this body; punaḥ – again; janma – birth; na – never; eti – does attain; mām – unto Me; eti – does attain; saḥ – he; arjuna – O Arjuna.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"janma\",\"translation\":\"birth\"},{\"word\":\"karma\",\"translation\":\"work\"},{\"word\":\"ca\",\"translation\":\"also\"},{\"word\":\"me\",\"translation\":\"of Mine\"},{\"word\":\"divyam\",\"translation\":\"transcendental\"},{\"word\":\"evam\",\"translation\":\"like this\"},{\"word\":\"yaḥ\",\"translation\":\"anyone who\"},{\"word\":\"vetti\",\"translation\":\"knows\"},{\"word\":\"tattvataḥ\",\"translation\":\"in reality\"},{\"word\":\"tyaktvā\",\"translation\":\"leaving aside\"},{\"word\":\"deham\",\"translation\":\"this body\"},{\"word\":\"punaḥ\",\"translation\":\"again\"},{\"word\":\"janma\",\"translation\":\"birth\"},{\"word\":\"na\",\"translation\":\"never\"},{\"word\":\"eti\",\"translation\":\"does attain\"},{\"word\":\"mām\",\"translation\":\"unto Me\"},{\"word\":\"eti\",\"translation\":\"does attain\"},{\"word\":\"saḥ\",\"translation\":\"he\"},{\"word\":\"arjuna\",\"translation\":\"O Arjuna\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1335,\"bb\":1189,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1189/\",\"body_value\":\"One who knows the transcendental nature of My appearance and activities does not, upon leaving the body, take his birth again in this material world, but attains My eternal abode, O Arjuna.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1336,\"bb\":1190,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1190/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1337,\"bb\":1191,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1191/\",\"body_value\":\"eko devo nitya-līlānurakto
bhakta-vyāpī hṛdy antar-ātmā\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1338,\"bb\":1192,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1192/\",\"body_value\":\"$26\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1339,\"bb\":1193,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1193/\",\"body_value\":\"tam eva viditvāti mṛtyum eti
nānyaḥ panthā vidyate ’yanāya\"},{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1340,\"bb\":1194,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/9/b1194/\",\"body_value\":\"“One can attain the perfect stage of liberation from birth and death simply by knowing the Lord, the Supreme Personality of Godhead, and there is no other way to achieve this perfection.” (Śvetāśvatara Upaniṣad 3.8) That there is no alternative means that anyone who does not understand Lord Kṛṣṇa as the Supreme Personality of Godhead is surely in the mode of ignorance and consequently he will not attain salvation simply, so to speak, by licking the outer surface of the bottle of honey, or by interpreting the Bhagavad-gītā according to mundane scholarship. Such empiric philosophers may assume very important roles in the material world, but they are not necessarily eligible for liberation. Such puffed-up mundane scholars have to wait for the causeless mercy of the devotee of the Lord. One should therefore cultivate Kṛṣṇa consciousness with faith and knowledge, and in this way attain perfection.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 4.9\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 4.9\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"2b:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n31:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/sta