क्षिप्रं हि मानुषे लोके सिद्धिर्भवति कर्मजा ॥ १२ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":1361,\"bb\":1212,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/12/b1212/\",\"body_value\":\"kāṅkṣantaḥ karmaṇāṁ siddhiṁ
yajanta iha devatāḥ
kṣipraṁ hi mānuṣe loke
siddhir bhavati karma-jā\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":1362,\"bb\":1213,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/12/b1213/\",\"shadow_value\":\"kāṅkṣantaḥ – desiring; karmaṇām – of fruitive activities; siddhim – perfection; yajante – they worship by sacrifices; iha – in the material world; devatāḥ – the demigods; kṣipram – very quickly; hi – certainly; mānuṣe – in human society; loke – within this world; siddhiḥ – success; bhavati – comes; karma-jā – from fruitive work.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"kāṅkṣantaḥ\",\"translation\":\"desiring\"},{\"word\":\"karmaṇām\",\"translation\":\"of fruitive activities\"},{\"word\":\"siddhim\",\"translation\":\"perfection\"},{\"word\":\"yajante\",\"translation\":\"they worship by sacrifices\"},{\"word\":\"iha\",\"translation\":\"in the material world\"},{\"word\":\"devatāḥ\",\"translation\":\"the demigods\"},{\"word\":\"kṣipram\",\"translation\":\"very quickly\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"mānuṣe\",\"translation\":\"in human society\"},{\"word\":\"loke\",\"translation\":\"within this world\"},{\"word\":\"siddhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"success\"},{\"word\":\"bhavati\",\"translation\":\"comes\"},{\"word\":\"karma-jā\",\"translation\":\"from fruitive work\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":1363,\"bb\":1214,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/12/b1214/\",\"body_value\":\"Men in this world desire success in fruitive activities, and therefore they worship the demigods. Quickly, of course, men get results from fruitive work in this world.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":1364,\"bb\":1215,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/4/12/b1215/\",\"body_value\":\"$25\"}]}],\"short_